    "title": "EF Core Migrations Squasher",
    "version": "1.2.0",
    "description": "A powerful CLI tool to consolidate multiple Entity Framework Core migrations into a single migration. Automatically extracts Up and Down methods while maintaining full schema history and rollback capability."
  },
